sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant Client as SearchWorkerClient
    participant Loader as StationLoader
    participant Worker as SearchWorker
    Note over UI,Worker: ① df 分片化后——Worker 仅按查询词桶懒加载 df
    UI->>Client: searchViaWorker(bundle, query)
    Client->>Client: ensureInitialized (只传 dfMeta: totalDocs/avgLen)
    Client->>Loader: loadDfForTerms(tokenize(query))
    Loader->>Loader: bucketIdx = fnv1a(term) & (B-1)
    Loader->>Loader: fetchText df/bucket-NNN.json（缓存优先+单飞去重）
    Loader-->>Client: Map<term, df>
    Client->>Worker: dfb { buckets: [{n, df}] }
    Client->>Worker: search { id, query }
    Worker->>Worker: 合并 df 到 dfMap；engine.searchL2
    Worker-->>Client: result { groups, hitCount, tookMs }
    Client-->>UI: SearchResultGroup[]

    Note over UI,Worker: ③ 批量生成管线——runner 逐条：生成→解析→staging→lint 回路→state
    participant Runner
    participant Provider as LLMProvider
    participant Staging
    participant Lint as lintEntryDir
    Runner->>Runner: 读取 work-order + .pks-gen-state.json（断点续跑）
    loop 每条 pending item
        Runner->>Provider: generate(prompt 含 outline/sources/material)
        Provider-->>Runner: { text }
        Runner->>Runner: parse-output → files map
        Runner->>Staging: write content/.staging/{slug}/
        Runner->>Lint: lintEntryDir(stagingVfs, slug)
        alt lint 失败 且 attempts < 3
            Runner->>Provider: generate(prompt + 错误反馈)
        else 通过
            Runner->>Runner: state[slug] = done
        end
    end
    Runner-->>Human: pks gen promote {slug} → content/entries/{slug}/
